# Build output and test artefacts. These sit under directories the format
# globs cover, so without this they get scanned whenever they happen to exist.
dist
test-results
playwright-report
demo/output
eval/results

# Markdown is deliberately not formatted. AGENTS.md and README.md are
# hand-wrapped, and reflowing them turns every prose edit into a churn diff.

# bin/md-redline is the CLI entry point and has no extension, so Prettier
# cannot infer a parser for it. It is excluded by the globs already; this note
# is here so the omission reads as deliberate rather than forgotten.
